    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald are delighted to welcome you to this stunning, superbly appointed four/five-bedroom end-of-terrace family home, discreetly positioned within a peaceful and highly sought-after residential enclave in Clonskeagh, Dublin 14. Beautifully decorated and presented to an exceptional standard, this impressive residence offers a discerning purchaser a superb turnkey home in one of South Dublin's most established and desirable residential locations. This fine property combines contemporary elegance with practical family living. Generously proportioned accommodation is complemented by excellent natural light, quality finishes and a thoughtful layout, creating a home that is both stylish and exceptionally comfortable. A particular feature is the large open-plan living and dining space, which provides an impressive setting for both relaxed family life and entertaining. The accommodation further benefits from a private north west facing garden, underground parking and excellent access to a host of amenities, schools and transport links. \n\nThe property enjoys a wonderfully peaceful setting while remaining exceptionally convenient to some of Dublin's most sought-after educational institutions. A selection of highly regarded schools within easy reach includes: Sandford National School, Ranelagh Multi-Denominational School, Mount Anville Secondary School, St. Kilian's German School, Coláiste Eoin, Coláiste Íosagáin, Alexandra College, Sandford Park School. The property is also within walking distance of University College Dublin (UCD), making this an especially attractive location for families seeking excellent educational facilities at all levels. \n\nThe location offers superb transport connections, with convenient access to the N11 and M50, providing easy connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond. Regular bus services are available nearby, offering straightforward access to Dublin city centre, Ballsbridge, Donnybrook, Ranelagh and surrounding areas. \n\nResidents enjoy an excellent choice of sporting, leisure and recreational facilities close by, including UCD Sport & Fitness and David Lloyd Riverview. For those seeking health and wellbeing facilities, Platinum Pilates and specialist Reformer Pilates studios are also within easy reach. The surrounding area is particularly appealing for outdoor pursuits, with attractive walking routes and green spaces nearby. The picturesque canal-side walks towards Bushy Park and Ballsbridge, together with Deer Park, provide wonderful opportunities for walking, running and enjoying the outdoors.\n\nNo. 4 Longwood represents a rare opportunity to acquire an exceptionally well-presented and versatile family home in one of South Dublin's most desirable residential locations.\nCombining generous proportions, superb bedroom accommodation, private outdoor space, secure underground parking and an enviable Clonskeagh address, this is a home that offers both elegance and practicality.\n\nThe property is ideally suited to a growing family, while the additional reception room/fifth bedroom provides the flexibility to accommodate changing family needs, working from home or visiting guests.\n\nPeaceful, private and exceptionally convenient, No. 4 Longwood is a truly outstanding family home and is sure to appeal to purchasers seeking quality, space and location in equal measure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \nUpon entering, a welcoming reception hall immediately sets the tone, featuring attractive stone porcelain flooring and an elegant mahogany staircase.\n\nLiving/ dining room - \nThe heart of the home is undoubtedly the impressive large open-plan living and dining room. Generous wall-to-wall windows flood the room with natural light, while the continuation of the porcelain flooring creates a seamless and sophisticated flow throughout the space.The dining area opens through patio doors directly onto the private garden, creating an ideal extension of the living accommodation during the warmer months.\n\nKitchen - \nThe bright and well-appointed kitchen is positioned conveniently off the dining area and features a range of modern fitted appliances together with attractive granite worktops. The layout allows the kitchen, dining and living areas to work effortlessly together, making this an excellent space for both everyday family life and entertaining.\n\nUtility Room - \nA separate utility room provides additional practicality and incorporates a washing machine and dryer, while a rear door gives access to the side passage and provides convenient access to both the front and rear gardens.\n\nGuest WC - \nA guest WC completes the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nFirst Floor - \nThe first floor continues the impressive sense of space and light, offering versatile accommodation that can be configured to suit a variety of family requirements.\n\nReception Room/Study - \nA large second reception room/study or potential fifth bedroom provides exceptional flexibility. Finished with beautiful walnut flooring and enjoying an abundance of natural light, this is an ideal space for a home office, children's playroom, additional sitting room or occasional guest accommodation.\n\nPrincipal bedroom - \nThe impressive principal bedroom is a wonderful private retreat, featuring large bay windows which allow natural light to flood the room. There is excellent built-in wardrobe provision together with a spacious en-suite bathroom incorporating both a bath and separate shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nThe generous double bedroom is bright and welcoming, with excellent built-in wardrobe space and a stylish en-suite shower room.\n\nHot press - \nA generous walk-in hot press provides valuable additional storage.\n\nSecond Floor - \nThe second floor provides two further exceptionally spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from built-in wardrobes and their own en-suite facilities.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nThis bedroom is particularly generous in proportion and enjoys excellent natural light, together with a beautifully appointed en-suite bathroom.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nThe fourth bedroom is equally impressive and features patio doors opening onto a private, Zen-style terrace. This secluded outdoor space provides a wonderful retreat for morning coffee, relaxation or enjoying the evening sunshine and sunsets.\n\nGarden - \nThe garden is designed for ease of maintenance and provides a wonderfully private setting for outdoor dining, entertaining and family barbecues. High surrounding walls and mature planting further enhance both privacy and tranquillity.A particularly useful feature is the direct access from the garden to the underground car park via garden steps, providing exceptional convenience when bringing shopping or other items directly into the home.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Additional Features</li><li> Four generous double bedrooms plus versatile fifth bedroom/reception room</li><li> Multiple en-suite bedrooms</li><li> Secure underground parking for two cars</li><li> Private, self-contained storage unit</li><li> Private south-west facing patio garden</li><li> Private upper-floor terrace</li><li> Beautiful walnut and porcelain flooring to inc walnut staircase</li><li> Recently redecorated throughout</li><li> Turnkey condition</li><li> Excellent natural light</li><li> Highly sought-after Clonskeagh location</li><li> Close to UCD and many prestigious schools</li><li> Excellent N11 and M50 connectivity</ul>"
      },
